# Cargo build output
/target/

# `tauri android init` / `tauri ios init` output and the generated ACL schemas.
# The Android Gradle project is regenerated on every CI run and re-patched by
# scripts/patch-android-signing.ts, so nothing under gen/ belongs in git.
/gen/

# C-30: signing material never enters the repository.
/gen/android/release.jks
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
